// The compile-time reflection descriptors (design.md "Compile-time
// reflection").
//
// `fields_of` and `enum_values_of` already produce values of these types; this
// package gives them their written names. The compiler contributes both, so
// `meta.Field` is the identity M4b created rather than a second nominal type.
//
// They remain compile-time-only: naming a descriptor type does not make a
// descriptor storable at run time.
@(public)
package meta;

// The compiler contributes:
//
//   Field       a record field: name, declared type, declaration index, tag
//   Enum_Value  an enum member: name, value, declaration index
